        (format "Chain Zero | StoaChain Genesis\n\nHonest rules, written once, ask nothing of those who come after.\nA ceiling that slides without end — not toward abundance, but toward permanence.\nPromises encoded in math outlast every institution ever built by man.\nPerpetual emission is not inflation. It is the fee paid to keep the lights on, forever.\nYet this chain was not made to be praised. It was made to endure.\n\nBuilt for the miner in 2226, in a world we cannot imagine,\nIn the year 3025, and in every year beyond that still.\nReaching never zero — only approaching silence, then holding just above it.\nThe emission curve is set. No vote will ever move it.\nHard-coded at genesis, removed from human hands, loyal only to time.\n\nDo not argue what ought to be built. Build it.\nAnd do not promise what the future should look like. Encode it.\nYet let the ledger speak long after we no longer can.\n\nEvery old chain refused to ask the question this one answers.\nMoney that endures must be designed for those who were not yet born.\nMade not for markets, not for cycles — but for our children's children.\nAnd theirs.\n\nP.S. — She turns {} today. May she outlast every block ever mined. 🎂" [11])
    ]
    
    

